<Layouts.app flash={@flash}>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-2 sm:px-4 py-4 sm:py-8">
    <.header>
      Config File
      <:subtitle>Save the running configuration as a pp.exs, or import one over it</:subtitle>
      <:actions>
        <.button
          href={~p"/admin/config/export"}
          download
          class="btn-primary btn-xs sm:btn-sm gap-1"
        >
          <.icon name="hero-arrow-down-tray" class="size-4 sm:size-5" />
          <span class="hidden sm:inline">Download pp.exs</span>
          <span class="sm:hidden">Download</span>
        </.button>
      </:actions>
    </.header>

    <div class="alert alert-info alert-soft mt-4 text-sm">
      <.icon name="hero-information-circle" class="size-5 shrink-0" />
      <span>
        Every other admin page edits memory only — <code>pp.exs</code>
        is read once at boot and never written back. Downloading here is how a session's work
        survives a restart: put the file where you start the client from. The download carries
        the credentials in full; the preview below has them replaced with <code>:redacted</code>.
      </span>
    </div>

    <%!-- Import --%>
    <div class="card bg-base-100 shadow-xl mt-4 sm:mt-6">
      <div class="card-body p-4 sm:p-6">
        <h2 class="card-title text-base sm:text-lg">
          <.icon name="hero-arrow-up-tray" class="size-5" /> Import
        </h2>

        <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">
          Endpoints, servers, profiles, conditions and DNS records are all replaced by what the
          file says — anything it leaves out is gone afterwards. The listeners are rebound as part
          of it. The <code>web:</code>
          section is kept for the next download but only takes effect at the next restart, since
          this page is served by the endpoint it configures.
        </p>

        <form id="import-form" phx-submit="import" phx-change="validate" class="mt-2">
          <div
            phx-drop-target={@uploads.config.ref}
            class="rounded-box border-2 border-dashed border-base-300 p-4 transition-colors hover:border-primary/50"
          >
            <.live_file_input
              upload={@uploads.config}
              class="file-input file-input-bordered file-input-sm sm:file-input-md w-full"
            />
          </div>

          <%!-- Choosing a file stages it; nothing is replaced until the button below
                is pressed, which is the confirmation step for a destructive action. --%>
          <div
            :for={entry <- @uploads.config.entries}
            class="alert alert-warning alert-soft mt-3 flex-col items-stretch gap-3 text-sm sm:flex-row sm:items-center"
          >
            <.icon name="hero-exclamation-triangle" class="size-5 shrink-0" />
            <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <p>
                <span class="font-mono font-semibold">{entry.client_name}</span>
                is ready. Importing it replaces the whole running configuration and rebinds the
                listeners.
              </p>
              <p :if={upload_errors(@uploads.config, entry) != []} class="mt-1 text-error">
                {Enum.map_join(
                  upload_errors(@uploads.config, entry),
                  ", ",
                  &upload_error_message/1
                )}
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex shrink-0 gap-2">
              <button
                type="button"
                phx-click="cancel_upload"
                phx-value-ref={entry.ref}
                class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm"
              >
                Cancel
              </button>
              <button type="submit" class="btn btn-warning btn-sm gap-1">
                <.icon name="hero-arrow-path-rounded-square" class="size-4" />
                Replace configuration
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p :for={error <- upload_errors(@uploads.config)} class="mt-2 text-sm text-error">
            {upload_error_message(error)}
          </p>
        </form>

        <div :if={@import_error} class="alert alert-error alert-soft mt-3 text-sm items-start">
          <.icon name="hero-exclamation-triangle" class="size-5 shrink-0" />
          <div class="min-w-0">
            <p class="font-semibold">The file was not applied, nothing changed.</p>
            <pre class="mt-1 overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre-wrap font-mono text-xs">{@import_error}</pre>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <%!-- Preview of what a download would contain --%>
    <div class="card bg-base-100 shadow-xl mt-4 sm:mt-6">
      <div class="card-body p-4 sm:p-6">
        <h2 class="card-title text-base sm:text-lg">
          <.icon name="hero-document-text" class="size-5" /> Preview
          <span class="badge badge-warning badge-sm gap-1">
            <.icon name="hero-eye-slash" class="size-3" /> credentials redacted
          </span>
        </h2>

        <div class="mt-2 max-h-[60vh] overflow-auto rounded-box bg-base-200">
          <pre class="p-3 sm:p-4 text-xs leading-relaxed"><code>{@preview}</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layouts.app>
